# Commit format (rule R3, .claude/rules/project-rules.json):
#
#   {TASK_ID}: {task title}
#
#   Gate {N} passed: {passed}/{total}, 0 skipped, 0 xfailed.
#   {one line on what changed}
#
# Repository owner's identity only. No co-author trailers. No AI attribution
# of any kind in the message, trailers, or body.
